{"id":"665212","name":"清蒸黄花鱼","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/665212/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄花鱼","amount":"1条"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱段","amount":"3段"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"3片"},{"name":"鲜花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红椒圈","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将黄花魚处理干净。","img":"images/665212/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入料酒、盐、白灼汁腌10分钟。","img":"images/665212/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中水烧开，黄花魚上放入姜片葱段。","img":"images/665212/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒸6分钟后将盘中的汤汁倒掉，然后再加入白灼汁、食用盐继续蒸5分钟。","img":"images/665212/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鲜花椒，红椒圈。","img":"images/665212/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒸好的黄花魚用鲜花椒红椒圈点缀。","img":"images/665212/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}